  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The contract asks for the simple difference in response rates (treatment proportion minus control proportion) on the defined population. The analyst reports an adjusted difference after stratifying by severity, which is not the estimand.",
    "Grounding: The numeric values cited (crude difference -0.0869, weighted averages 0.7813 and 0.6377, adjusted difference 0.1437, stratum-specific differences) do not appear in the printed output provided.",
    "Overreach: The answer refers to a \"treatment effect\" and implies causal interpretation, which goes beyond the observational difference requested."
  ]
}
